        <mxCell id="s-maint" value="Server-side session maintenance for Streamable HTTP is NOT documented by&#10;Microsoft Learn (checked 2026-08-04). The deprecated SSE transport documents an&#10;Azure Queue Storage backplane (AzureWebJobsStorage); Streamable HTTP has no&#10;documented equivalent. host.json encryptClientState (default true) suggests&#10;client-carried state, but the mechanism is undocumented. Drawn as a boundary,&#10;not a claim. The tool sees a SessionId on its invocation context (extension source)." style="rounded=1;fillColor=#fff9cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="786" width="720" height="118" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s-apimnote" value="All nine messages transit API Management as MCP&#10;passthrough. Learn does not document APIM altering&#10;Mcp-Session-Id, so no gateway session handling is shown.&#10;Header-by-header detail: docs/mcp-request-flow.md." style="rounded=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="780" y="786" width="470" height="118" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
